[% title = "Tags" %]

<div class="alert alert-warning">
    <i class="material-icons">warning</i>
    Support for tags is still <strong>work in progress</strong>.
</div>

[% FOR group IN groups %]
<h3>Tag Group [% group.name | html %]</h3>

<p>Tags:
    [% FOR tag IN group.tags %]
    <a href="[% tag.edit_url %]">[% tag.name | html %]</a>
    [% END %]
</p>
[% END %]

<h3>Other Tags</h3>

<p>Tags:
[% FOR tag IN other_tags %]
    <a href="[% tag.edit_url %]">[% tag.name | html %]</a>
[% END %]
</p>

[% WRAPPER includes/infobox.tt %]
    <em>Tags</em> are keywords that can be attached to recipes, dishes and articles.
    They can be used to filter them during search or to highlight important aspects.
</p>

<p>
    <em>Tag groups</em> can be used to organize similar tags together.
[% END %]
